sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Request the CSMS to send a SetDisplayMessageRequest

    CSMS->>CS: SetDisplayMessageRequest (state = <Configured display message state>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: SetDisplayMessageRequest<br>message.id = <Generated Id><br>message.priority = <Configured Priority><br>message.message.format = <Configured Format><br>message.state = <Configured State>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetDisplayMessageResponse (status = Accepted)
